01:07:38,823 --> 01:07:44,823
Wicker Park is a 2004 American romantic thriller drama film directed by Paul McGuigan
and starring Josh Hartnett, Rose Byrne, Diane Kruger and Matthew Lillard.

11
01:14:24,705 --> 01:14:30,705
It is a remake of the 1996 French film L'Appartement, which in turn is
loosely based on Shakespeare's A Midsummer Night's Dream.

12
01:21:10,588 --> 01:21:16,588
It was nominated for the Grand Prix at the Montreal World Film
Festival, the city in which the film was partially filmed.

13
01:27:56,470 --> 01:28:02,470
The title refers to the Wicker Park neighborhood
on Chicago's near northwest side.

14
01:34:42,352 --> 01:34:48,352
The film received generally negative reviews from
critics, and was a box-office disappointment.

15
01:41:28,235 --> 01:41:34,235
The film explores themes of love of one's life, leave, look-alike, intrigue.

